OL,5,G0405 Location, Location, Location
OL,6,     FKirstie and Phil are on the south
OL,7,     Fcoast. Jo and Kev want an
OL,8,     Fadaptable home suited to their
OL,9,     Fdaughter Cody, who has cerebral
OL,10,     Fpalsy. Alice and Jack are
OL,11,     Fsearching in pricey Worthing.
OL,12,G0500 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FIn Aberdeen, Jen and Callum go
OL,14,     Fall-out American, while their
OL,15,     Frivals Debbie and Shaun, and Sam
OL,16,     Fand Jamie, are shocked to discover
OL,17,     Fthat they're serving
OL,18,     Fnear-identical Scottish menus.
